{"title": "Shadowthief", "pageid": 28569, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shadowthief", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Shadowthief</b> is a passive feature that grants extra damage against obscured targets.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The wearer's weapon and unarmed attacks deal an additional <span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/46px-D4_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/62px-D4_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/D4_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <b>1d4</b> damage against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightly_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightly Obscured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightly_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightly Obscured (Condition)\">Lightly</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heavily_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Heavily Obscured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heavily Obscured\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heavily_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Heavily Obscured (Condition)\">Heavily Obscured</a> creatures, and creatures made of shadow. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cloaked_Ring\" title=\"Shadow-Cloaked Ring\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Ring_B_Gem_B_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_B_Gem_B_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Ring_B_Gem_B_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_B_Gem_B_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Ring_B_Gem_B_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_B_Gem_B_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Ring_B_Gem_B_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_B_Gem_B_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Ring_B_Gem_B_Gold_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cloaked_Ring\" title=\"Shadow-Cloaked Ring\">Shadow-Cloaked Ring</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Mastiff_Alpha\" title=\"Shadow Mastiff Alpha\">Shadow Mastiff Alpha</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Though not mentioned in the description, Shadowthief also increases the damage of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> attacks.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>On a Throw attack with a weapon with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/38px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/50px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thrown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a> property, Shadowthief activates for an additional time.</li></ul>\n</div>  <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">The wearer's weapon and unarmed attacks deal an additional <b>1d4</b> damage against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightly_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightly Obscured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightly_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightly Obscured (Condition)\">Lightly</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heavily_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Heavily Obscured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heavily Obscured\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heavily_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Heavily Obscured (Condition)\">Heavily Obscured</a> creatures, and creatures made of shadow.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202153\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.064 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.073 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2322/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20699/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8088/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 163/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 968622/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   64.326      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   64.326      1 -total\n 28.89%   18.585      6 Template:Icon_link\n 28.81%   18.535      2 Template:Cond\n 27.87%   17.928      6 Template:Icon_text\n 23.76%   15.286   